This snippet from CMakeLists.txt (in the base directory) is probably
the one giving you problems:

if (CMAKE_COMPILER_IS_GNUCC)
    set (CMAKE_C_FLAGS_DEBUG "-Wall -g3 -Wold-style-definition -Wstrict-prototypes -Wmissing-prototypes -Wmissing-declarations -Wpointer-arith")
    if (UNIX)
	add_definitions (-fvisibility=hidden)
    endif ()
endif ()

Presumably in cywin the UNIX flag is set to true.  Although I'm not sure
if that option's required, you could try deleting the if(UNIX) block
and see if that does the trick.



